      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s2lv",
          "text": "Equipment performance can also create danger when braking systems malfunction or steering becomes unstable. When mechanical issues contribute to a crash, investigators evaluate whether reasonable maintenance and deployment standards were followed, including:",
