          "_key": "s2nc",
          "text": "Shared scooter apps require acceptance of rental agreements containing waiver and arbitration provisions. Although those terms often appear restrictive, they do not automatically eliminate legal rights when negligence or defective equipment contributed to harm. At the same time, understanding available insurance coverage becomes equally important, since claims may involve multiple policies, including a driver’s auto policy and a scooter operator’s commercial coverage.",
          "marks": []
        }
